WEBVTT

00:00:00.158 --> 00:00:04.601
Everything lives in one workspace folder.

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:08.188
deployment.yaml points at the workspace folder.

00:00:08.188 --> 00:00:14.232
Inside: apps, integrations, gateways and auth providers.

00:00:15.493 --> 00:00:22.209
The console shows which workspace you are editing.

00:00:22.209 --> 00:00:25.584
The chip at the top shows the active folder.

00:00:25.584 --> 00:00:28.081
Change workspace to switch between Git checkouts.

00:00:28.081 --> 00:00:33.407
Type or browse for a folder. We will cancel.

00:00:34.175 --> 00:00:51.698
Treat the workspace like code.
